#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:2
msgid "Reproducible compilation"
msgstr "可复现的编译"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:4
msgid ""
"Since 0.6.0, :func:`quspect.transpiler.transpile` gives **bit-identical**"
" results on every supported platform: for the same input circuit, target,"
" options and integer ``seed``, the output gates (names, qubits and every "
"bit of every parameter) and the initial and final layouts are the same on"
" macOS arm64, Linux x86_64 (both the AVX2 and the scalar extension "
"module), Linux aarch64 and Windows AMD64, for every supported Python "
"version, any number of compile threads (``QUSPECT_COMPILE_THREADS``) and "
"any ``PYTHONHASHSEED``."
msgstr ""
"从 0.6.0 起，:func:`quspect.transpiler.transpile` 在所有受支持的平台上给出\\ **逐位一致**\\ "
"的结果：对相同的输入线路、目标、选项和整数 ``seed``，输出的门（名称、比特以及每个参数的每一位）和初始、最终布局在 macOS "
"arm64、Linux x86_64（AVX2 与 scalar 两种扩展模块）、Linux aarch64 和 Windows AMD64 "
"上都相同，与 Python 版本（所有受支持的版本）、编译线程数（``QUSPECT_COMPILE_THREADS``）和 "
"``PYTHONHASHSEED`` 无关。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:13
msgid ""
"A circuit compiled on a laptop can therefore be reproduced exactly on a "
"cluster node or in CI, and compilation results can be compared or cached "
"by their bytes."
msgstr "因此，在笔记本上编译的线路可以在集群节点或 CI 中精确复现，编译结果也可以按字节比较或缓存。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:18
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "实现方式"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:20
msgid ""
"Everything numerical on the compilation path runs in the C++ extension on"
" a small deterministic numerics layer instead of numpy, BLAS/LAPACK or "
"the platform math library:"
msgstr "编译路径上的全部数值计算都在 C++ 扩展中、在一个小型确定性数值层上完成，不再依赖 numpy、BLAS/LAPACK 或平台数学库："

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Fixed floating-point rules.**  The compiler sources are built without "
"floating-point contraction (``-ffp-contract=off -fno-fast-math``, "
"``/fp:precise``); fused multiply-adds appear only where they are written "
"explicitly (``std::fma`` is correctly rounded everywhere).  Every sum and"
" product is evaluated in a fixed order, so the AVX2 and the scalar "
"modules execute the same operations."
msgstr ""
"**固定的浮点规则。**\\  编译器源文件关闭浮点收缩（``-ffp-contract=off -fno-fast-"
"math``、``/fp:precise``）；融合乘加只出现在显式写出的地方（``std::fma`` "
"在所有平台上都是正确舍入的）。所有求和与乘积都按固定顺序计算，因此 AVX2 与 scalar 模块执行完全相同的运算。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Own small-matrix linear algebra.**  The compiler only needs 2×2, 4×4 "
"and 8×8 complex matrices: products, determinants, Jacobi "
"eigendecompositions (real symmetric and Hermitian), one-sided Jacobi SVD,"
" Householder QR and the cosine–sine decomposition used by the three-qubit"
" resynthesis are implemented with fixed sequences of IEEE operations."
msgstr ""
"**自带小矩阵线性代数。**\\  编译器只需要 2×2、4×4 和 8×8 复矩阵：矩阵乘积、行列式、Jacobi "
"特征分解（实对称与厄米）、单边 Jacobi SVD、Householder QR 以及三比特重综合所用的余弦–正弦分解，都由固定步骤的 IEEE"
" 运算实现。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Correctly rounded math functions.**  ``sin``, ``cos``, ``tan``, "
"``asin``, ``acos``, ``atan``, ``atan2``, ``exp``, ``log`` and ``pow`` "
"come from the `CORE-MATH <https://core-math.gitlabpages.inria.fr/>`_ "
"project (correct rounding leaves exactly one admissible result); "
"``hypot`` and ``atan2`` at extreme ratios use short own implementations "
"built only from IEEE operations, ``fma`` and ``sqrt``.  This covers gate "
"matrices, the single- and two-qubit synthesis, block consolidation, gauge"
" and CX orientation, the three-qubit resynthesis, routing heuristics and "
"the numeric functions of the OpenQASM 2 parser."
msgstr ""
"**正确舍入的数学函数。**\\  "
"``sin``、``cos``、``tan``、``asin``、``acos``、``atan``、``atan2``、``exp``、``log``"
" 和 ``pow`` 来自 `CORE-MATH <https://core-math.gitlabpages.inria.fr/>`_ "
"项目（正确舍入只允许唯一的结果）；``hypot`` 以及极端比值下的 ``atan2`` 使用只由 IEEE 运算、``fma`` 和 "
"``sqrt`` 构成的简短自有实现。覆盖范围包括门矩阵、单比特与两比特合成、块合并、gauge 与 CX 朝向、三比特重综合、路由启发式以及 "
"OpenQASM 2 解析器中的数值函数。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Deterministic search.**  Routing scores are computed exactly and ties "
"are broken by a C++ reimplementation of CPython's Mersenne Twister seeded"
" from ``seed``; parallel work (routing trials, window searches, "
"scheduling, the gauge search) is written by index and merged in a fixed "
"order, so the thread count only changes the running time; no result "
"depends on the iteration order of a hashed container."
msgstr ""
"**确定性的搜索。**\\  路由打分精确计算，平局由 CPython 梅森旋转随机数发生器的 C++ 复刻（以 ``seed`` "
"为种子）打破；并行工作（路由尝试、窗口搜索、调度、gauge "
"搜索）按下标写入结果并按固定顺序合并，线程数只影响运行时间；没有任何结果依赖哈希容器的迭代顺序。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:51
msgid ""
":func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.kak_decompose`, "
":func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.weyl_coordinates` and "
":meth:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.from_matrix` use the same "
"deterministic KAK decomposition."
msgstr ""
":func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.kak_decompose`、:func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.weyl_coordinates`"
" 和 :meth:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.from_matrix` 使用同一个确定性 "
"KAK 分解。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:57
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:59
msgid ""
"The test suite stores SHA-256 digests of complete compilations "
"(``tests/transpiler/test_golden_transpile.py``: generated circuits on "
"line, ring, grid and fully connected targets with three gate sets at "
"levels 1–3) and of the synthesis kernels on platform-independent inputs "
"(``tests/synthesis/test_native_kak.py``).  CI checks them on every "
"platform and with both x86_64 modules, including on an emulated CPU "
"without AVX2; the same tests also compile with different thread counts "
"and hash seeds. ``tools/det_fingerprint.py`` produces full dumps "
"(``float.hex`` of every parameter) for larger cross-machine comparisons."
msgstr ""
"测试集保存了完整编译结果的 SHA-256 "
"摘要（``tests/transpiler/test_golden_transpile.py``：生成的线路在线形、环形、网格和全连接目标上，三种门集，优化级别"
" 1–3），以及合成内核在平台无关输入上的摘要（``tests/synthesis/test_native_kak.py``）。CI "
"在每个平台上、并对 x86_64 的两种模块（包括在模拟的无 AVX2 CPU "
"上）检查这些摘要；同一组测试还会在不同的线程数和哈希种子下编译。``tools/det_fingerprint.py`` "
"可以输出完整的记录（每个参数的 ``float.hex``），用于更大规模的跨机器比较。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:70
msgid "Scope and exceptions"
msgstr "范围与例外"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:72
msgid ""
"The guarantee applies to the same QuSpect version with its compiled "
"extension module (always present in the published wheels).  It does "
"**not** cover:"
msgstr "这一保证适用于同一 QuSpect 版本及其编译好的扩展模块（发布的 wheel 中总是包含）。它\\ **不**\\ 包括："

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:76
msgid ""
"the pure-Python fallback, used when the extension module is missing or a "
"backend is forced to Python (``QUSPECT_SYNTHESIS_BACKEND``, "
"``QUSPECT_ROUTING_BACKEND``, ``QUSPECT_GAUGE_BACKEND``, "
"``QUSPECT_DAG_PASS_BACKEND`` set to ``python``): it uses numpy and the "
"platform math library and gives equivalent, but not bit-identical, "
"results;"
msgstr ""
"纯 Python 兜底实现：扩展模块缺失，或把某个后端强制设为 "
"Python（``QUSPECT_SYNTHESIS_BACKEND``、``QUSPECT_ROUTING_BACKEND``、``QUSPECT_GAUGE_BACKEND``、``QUSPECT_DAG_PASS_BACKEND``"
" 设为 ``python``）时使用。它依赖 numpy 和平台数学库，结果等价但不逐位一致；"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:81
msgid ""
"``seed=None`` (fresh operating-system entropy) and wall-clock limits "
"(``time_limit``): the result then depends on the run or on the machine "
"speed;"
msgstr "``seed=None``\\ （使用新的操作系统熵）和墙钟时间限制（``time_limit``）：此时结果取决于具体运行或机器速度；"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:84
msgid ""
"approximate synthesis (``approximation_degree < 1``): the approximation "
"candidates are still evaluated with numpy;"
msgstr "近似合成（``approximation_degree < 1``）：近似候选仍用 numpy 评估；"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:86
msgid ""
"the inputs themselves: parameters computed in Python with :mod:`math` or "
"numpy may differ in the last bit between platforms; the OpenQASM 2 parser"
" evaluates parameter expressions with the correctly rounded functions;"
msgstr ""
"输入本身：在 Python 中用 :mod:`math` 或 numpy 计算的参数在不同平台上可能有末位差异；OpenQASM 2 "
"解析器用正确舍入的函数计算参数表达式；"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:89
msgid ""
"numerical utilities outside compilation (for example "
":func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.approximation_error`, operators and "
"the simulators);"
msgstr ""
"编译之外的数值工具（例如 "
":func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.approximation_error`、算符与模拟器）；"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:92
msgid ""
"the pulse envelopes of :mod:`quspect.pulse`: Flattop and RippleRect "
"samples go through the platform ``erf`` and agree across platforms within"
" one ``float32`` ulp (see :doc:`pulse`)."
msgstr ""
":mod:`quspect.pulse` 的脉冲包络：Flattop 与 RippleRect 的采样经过平台的 ``erf``，各平台之间在一个"
" ``float32`` ulp 内一致（参见 :doc:`pulse`）。"

#: ../../source/reproducibility.rst:96
msgid ""
"Compiled outputs changed once, in 0.6.0, on every platform (macOS "
"included) when the deterministic layer replaced the numpy-based numerics;"
" the compilation quality is unchanged or better."
msgstr "编译输出在 0.6.0 中改变了一次（所有平台，包括 macOS）：确定性数值层取代了基于 numpy 的数值计算；编译质量不变或更好。"

